# TG-04 stage B (make test-tg-socket, at scale 1 and 2), the desktop's boot: tgd and tg were
# installed on this volume by the console's boot before it (tests/tg-install.script: install
# needs the volume's root, which only the console's shell holds). tgd serves the window on
# the socket file in its own directory, with an invented
# account (--synthetic: no TDLib, no network, the code 12345 and the password zoraya,
# which are not credentials of anything); tg started from the terminal as an installed
# window program (overlay 0003), reaching tgd only through its saved +sock grant.
# tg says on the serial line what it shows (the data is synthetic); the terminal is read
# for the shell's lines. Coordinates are logical: tg is the second window, its frame at
# (105, 103), its body at (105, 138), 840 x 520: the list's rows at y = 186 + 62 n.
serial init: gui: gpu on its own page
screen Type help to begin, or help tour.
screen ~> _
#
# tgd in the background, serving the invented account; then the window.
type tgd --window --synthetic &\r
prefix tgd: the window's socket is
type tg &\r
serial tg: login phone
pause 1500
click 500 119
pause 500
shot tgs-login
# The login through the socket: a wrong code is refused by tgd's AuthController.
type 0000\r
then tg: login code
type 00000\r
then tg: login refused: Wrong code
type 12345\r
then tg: login password
type zoraya\r
then tg: ready
serial tg: chats 7 from 0: "Mark Owens"
pause 500
shot tgs-list
# The frame's pills are tg's package and its socket only: where a pill of the current
# directory (+r /home) was, the frame's own colour (tg.cmd's cwd none, R28).
region 565 111 50 17 f7f7f8
#
# The club (row 6): its newest 40 messages, Cyrillic, a photo's placeholder; 47 were
# unread, more than the page, so the first unread one is not loaded yet: the pill at the
# top right (accent 3b4f6b) says how many.
click 255 589
then tg: opened "Книжковий клуб": 40 messages, last: Обкладинка
then tg: unread 47
then tg: chat "Книжковий клуб" unread 0
region 925 204 4 8 3b4f6b
pause 500
shot tgs-chat
#
# Step 4: a press on the pill jumps to the first unread message (an older page first), at
# the view's top under the "Unread messages" line; the pill goes. End is the newest.
click 927 208
then tg: older
then tg: first unread: Повідомлення номер 10
pause 500
shot tgs-unread
key end
then tg: newest
click 500 630
type hello over the socket\r
then tg: message "Книжковий клуб" out: hello over the socket
then tg: delivered: hello over the socket
#
# Protocol 3: a send that fails is shown failed (the error mark, "Not sent"), never
# pending; Up from the composer chooses it, Enter sends it again (tgd's resendMessages).
type /fail this one first fails\r
then tg: message "Книжковий клуб" out: /fail this one first fails
then tg: not sent: /fail this one first fails
pause 500
shot tgs-failed
key up
key ret
then tg: retry: /fail this one first fails
then tg: message "Книжковий клуб" out: /fail this one first fails
then tg: delivered: /fail this one first fails
pause 500
shot tgs-retried
#
# tgd's timer: a message to another chat raises its count.
serial tg: chat "Дмитро Шевченко" unread 2: Повідомлення з таймера 1
#
# tgd goes (kill in the terminal, raised by a press on its title bar): the window says so;
# started again, it is found again by itself, and the (invented) login is asked again.
click 300 87
pause 500
type kill %1\r
then tg: waiting: tgd went away
pause 500
shot tgs-gone
type tgd --window --synthetic &\r
then tg: login phone
